{"acronym": "DAMMT-TG", "archived": null, "badges": [], "contact_point": null, "created_at": "2024-12-17T16:31:44.108000+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Ces donn\u00e9es fournissent des informations sur les agents de Mobile Money de TOGOCOM op\u00e9rant au Togo. Elles incluent des d\u00e9tails sur la localisation des agents, leur statut (officiel ou affili\u00e9), ainsi que les services financiers qu'ils offrent (transfert d'argent, paiement de factures, retrait, etc.). Ces donn\u00e9es visent \u00e0 am\u00e9liorer l'acc\u00e8s aux services financiers mobiles, \u00e0 soutenir l'inclusion financi\u00e8re et \u00e0 faciliter la gestion des transactions mon\u00e9taires dans le pays.\nLien vers la source : [Cliquez ici]( https://geodata.gouv.tg/donnees/0c61c2c6-97d1-4117-9e37-1266a6e23e95)\n\nDonn\u00e9e priv\u00e9e, accessible uniquement sur demande.\nCette ressource contient uniquement la description des colonnes des donn\u00e9es r\u00e9elles (sch\u00e9ma de donn\u00e9es).\nLes donn\u00e9es compl\u00e8tes ne sont pas publiquement disponibles et peuvent \u00eatre obtenues sur demande aupr\u00e8s de l'entit\u00e9 productrice.", "extras": {}, "frequency": "irregular", "frequency_date": "2024-12-17T01:00:00+00:00", "harvest": null, "id": "6761a7707156b2067b148add", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2024-12-17T16:31:44.108000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-05-28T16:07:47.783000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-05-28T16:07:47.783000+00:00", "last_update": "2025-01-08T17:41:17.753000+00:00", "license": "other-open", "metrics": {"discussions": 0, "followers": 0, "resources_downloads": 17, "reuses": 0, "views": 40}, "organization": {"acronym": "MESPTN", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "6760c507695e9dfc6b747eb7", "logo": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/s/avatars/66/41b0a5e0bc49729d8d763552d3378b-original.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/s/avatars/66/41b0a5e0bc49729d8d763552d3378b-100.png", "name": "Minist\u00